    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo Vectors is a mouse-only game where you attack enemies by creating the correct patterns that appear next to them. The radar system also helps in your defense, and after each round you can upgrade it to gain new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840860/extras/589795bcf1d8961ca4541ce1615d6fc1.avif?t=1752573460\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are 3 radar systems, each with their own unique ability and movement pattern. Each time the radar detects an enemy, it can either trigger one of the upgrades you have selected, or it can activate its unique ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Upgrades that can change each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Lots of different enemies, with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a03 unique radar systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customization options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with\u00a0L\u00d6VE. Font for cover image is\u00a0m5x7 by Daniel Linssen. Trailer song is Final Level by\u00a0HoliznaCC0.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo Vectors is a mouse-only game where you attack enemies by creating the correct patterns that appear next to them. The radar system also helps in your defense, and after each round you can upgrade it to gain new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840860/extras/589795bcf1d8961ca4541ce1615d6fc1.avif?t=1752573460\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are 3 radar systems, each with their own unique ability and movement pattern. Each time the radar detects an enemy, it can either trigger one of the upgrades you have selected, or it can activate its unique ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Upgrades that can change each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Lots of different enemies, with different behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a03 unique radar systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customization options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with\u00a0L\u00d6VE. Font for cover image is\u00a0m5x7 by Daniel Linssen. Trailer song is Final Level by\u00a0HoliznaCC0.</p>",
